204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (Adoption over buying. Every puppy at Furrever Pals is sourced from local animal shelters and is available for adoption. Participants don't just attend a yoga class, they have the opportunity to find a lifelong companion. This partnership model gives shelter dogs a chance to connect with people in a positive, low-pressure environment.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
205 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 163 0 R
/E (Accessible wellness for everyone. Furrever Pals offers sessions across all experience levels, from first-timers to advanced practitioners. One-on-one personal training is also available for those who prefer a more tailored approach. The goal is to remove the barriers that keep people away from wellness spaces.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
