227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Puppy yoga is a guided wellness practice where participants move through yoga poses alongside adoptable puppies. Sessions are designed to welcome all experience levels, from complete beginners to seasoned practitioners.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (The concept draws on two well-established bodies of research. Regular yoga practice reduces cortisol levels, improves flexibility, and supports long-term mental health. Human-animal interaction has been shown to lower blood pressure, reduce anxiety, and increase oxytocin, the hormone associated with bonding and trust.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 165 0 R
/E (Together, these two elements create something neither could achieve alone: a wellness experience that is physically engaging, emotionally nourishing, and genuinely fun. Furrever Pals was designed to make that experience accessible to everyone in Vancouver.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
