/P 171 0 R
/E (A mood board is a visual collage of images, colours, and text that communicates the feeling of a brand before a single logo is drawn. It is one of the most important early steps in any branding project because it aligns intention with aesthetics. )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
310 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 171 0 R
/E (This mood board was built around four themes: companionship, movement, nature, and calm. The images were chosen to reflect the dual experience Furrever Pals offers: the physical energy of yoga and the emotional warmth of being with a dog.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
