/P 179 0 R
/E (Furrever Pals was designed in direct response to this gap. The brief was to create a brand that addressed a genuine community need through design. Rather than defaulting to a conventional wellness concept, I identified an opportunity to combine physical health, mental well-being, social connection, and animal welfare into a single, accessible service.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [1]
>>
