391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 180 0 R
/E (Rather than sourcing puppies from breeders, Furrever Pals operates as an official partner with local animal shelters across Vancouver. Every puppy who participates in a session is available for adoption. The yoga class becomes something more of a natural, low-pressure environment where people and dogs can find each other.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
